# Repo root as a build context (INF-08). No image builds from `.` today
# (every build: in docker-compose.yml has its own context: backend/,
# frontend/, gateway/, hw-monitor/, services/*, TRELLIS.2/), but until
# 2026-11-17 the ollama image did, and that sent the daemon .env with every
# secret, data/ (Postgres, uploaded files) and TRELLIS.2/ to the builder.
# This keeps a future `build: .` from doing it again. Each subdirectory
# context has its own .dockerignore; this file doesn't apply to them.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/
caddy/caddy_data/
caddy/caddy_config/
TRELLIS.2/
Hunyuan3D-2.1/
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
frontend/dist
benchmark/results/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
